  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/09/IMG_0747.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La tarde de este viernes se ha celebrado la primera sesi&oacute;n del nuevo curso del Club de Lectura de Onda sobre el libro Comarcal 415, de Carlos Rodr&iacute;guez Garrido, con la participaci&oacute;n del autor.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/clublecturaonda050914ambcarlosrodriguezgarrido/img_0742.jpg\" alt=\"img_0742\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/clublecturaonda050914ambcarlosrodriguezgarrido/img_0743.jpg\" alt=\"img_0743\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/clublecturaonda050914ambcarlosrodriguezgarrido/img_0744.jpg\" alt=\"img_0744\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/clublecturaonda050914ambcarlosrodriguezgarrido/img_0745.jpg\" alt=\"img_0745\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/clublecturaonda050914ambcarlosrodriguezgarrido/img_0746.jpg\" alt=\"img_0746\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/clublecturaonda050914ambcarlosrodriguezgarrido/img_0747.jpg\" alt=\"img_0747\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/clublecturaonda050914ambcarlosrodriguezgarrido/img_0749.jpg\" alt=\"img_0749\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/clublecturaonda050914ambcarlosrodriguezgarrido/img_0750.jpg\" alt=\"img_0750\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
